    "logo": "",
    "aboutText": "The Skill Development & Entrepreneurship Department of the Karbi Anglong Autonomous Council works to give the youth of Karbi Anglong and West Karbi Anglong the skills they need for jobs and self-employment.\nThe department runs free, short-term training courses in sectors such as IT, hospitality, healthcare, construction, agriculture and traditional handloom, through skill centres across the two districts. Training follows national skill standards (NSQF), and every trainee who passes the final assessment receives a certificate that employers can verify online.\nAfter certification, the department helps trainees take the next step through on-the-job training with employers and support for starting their own small enterprises.",
