      "description": "Skill Development & Entrepreneurship Department, KAAC invites applications from interested candidates from Karbi Anglong and West Karbi Anglong districts for the engagement of 40 Trainers under the Department of Skill Development & Entrepreneurship, Karbi Anglong Autonomous Council (KAAC), Diphu.",
