      "minAge": 25,
      "maxAge": 40,
      "remuneration": "Starting from ₹6,000 per month",
      "selection": "After receiving the applications, shortlisted candidates will be invited for an interview / personality test. Selected candidates may be provided with Training of Trainers (ToT) and certification, subject to the applicable training and certification requirements.",
